<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Scharrig Mining yr shr falls, div held.</title>
<headline>Scharrig Mining yr shr falls, div held.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     10.0	  vs  17.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  4.0	  vs   4.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   13.61	 vs  20.97</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   14.12	 vs  18.29</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.91	 vs   2.68 rebate</p>
<p>    Net finance charges   12.82	 vs   9.99</p>
<p>    Turnover		 221.46	 vs 210.38</p>
<p>Div payable May 23</p>
<p>on register April 30</p>
<p>Full name: Scharrig Mining Ltd</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	    -	   vs   2.05</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said its capital expenditure programme over the last three years had put it in an excellent position to take on additional work.</p>
<p>It said positive feedback on various tenders submitted would forecast good reuslts during 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
